cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "highentDCA: entropy-based decimation for maximum-entropy Direct Coupling Analysis models"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the entropy-based decimation procedure used to
  identify maximum-entropy Direct Coupling Analysis models (meDCA) along a
  sparse Potts-model training trajectory. Built on adabmDCA for
  Boltzmann-machine training, Monte Carlo sampling, and model I/O.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/robertonetti/highentropyDCA"
url: "https://robertonetti.github.io/highentropyDCA/"
keywords:
  - direct coupling analysis
  - Potts model
  - Boltzmann machine
  - protein sequences
  - generative models
  - entropy
